WebKD

This distribution includes modified components from the following projects:

- LLaMA-Factory: https://github.com/hiyouga/LLaMA-Factory
  The integration files and training-time alignment helpers retain their
  Apache-2.0 notices. Modifications add WebKD weights, masks, and the frozen
  student anchor.

- AgentLab: https://github.com/ServiceNow/AgentLab
  Copyright 2024 ServiceNow. The trajectory-recording adapter extends the
  Apache-2.0 generic-agent interface.

- WebAgent-R1: https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.16421
  The policy-gradient baseline adapts the Apache-2.0 verifiers training core
  for TimeWarp. Its license is also included under baselines/rl/LICENSE.

Upstream names and notices are retained for attribution; no endorsement is implied.
